# Automation & QA Assignment

## Task 1
Performed manual QA testing on OpenCart Demo Store.

Tested:
- Product search
- Cart functionality
- Validation
- Mobile responsiveness
- Accessibility

## Task 2
Built an n8n workflow that:
- Fetches trending GitHub repositories
- Filters repositories
- Sends Discord alerts
- Handles API failures

## Bonus Task
Implemented uptime monitoring workflow for OpenCart using:
- Schedule Trigger
- HTTP Request
- IF logic
- Discord alerts

## Tools Used
- n8n
- Discord Webhooks
- Chrome DevTools
- GitHub
